| `sort()` | Sorting |
| `reverse()` | Reversing |
| `binary_search()` | Binary search |
| `lower_bound()` | First element >= target |
| `upper_bound()` | First element > target |
| `max_element()` | Maximum element |
| `min_element()` | Minimum element |
| `accumulate()` | Sum |
| `count()` | Count occurrences |
| `find()` | Find element |
