# 4. Final Practice Test

Solve all 10 problems using C++ without referring to Java solutions.

- [ ] Two Sum — `unordered_map`
- [ ] Valid Parentheses — `stack`
- [ ] Top K Frequent Elements — `unordered_map` + `priority_queue`
- [ ] Merge Intervals — `vector` + sorting
- [ ] Next Permutation — STL algorithms
- [ ] Binary Search — `lower_bound` / manual implementation
- [ ] Reverse Linked List — pointers
- [ ] Binary Tree Level Order Traversal — queue + tree pointers
- [ ] Number of Islands — graph + DFS/BFS
- [ ] Number of Provinces — DSU / DFS

